mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/f07f4ba3b166c9cd77f4f1adcf411b45.webm?t=1646765113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/f07f4ba3b166c9cd77f4f1adcf411b45.mp4?t=1646765113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Ready for some challenges? Time for the training!</strong><br>Learn special gestures and instruct your pet to perform different tricks - if you\u2019re consistent it gets easier in time but be aware the pet can also forget some lessons!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/18043de2fca9cbf7f304580dc17cef73.poster.avif?t=1646765113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/18043de2fca9cbf7f304580dc17cef73.webm?t=1646765113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/18043de2fca9cbf7f304580dc17cef73.mp4?t=1646765113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Create an amazing collection</strong><br>Reward yourself and your pupil \u2013 make it fancy! Exchange points to create your own collection of fun accessories for you and your pet to enjoy. Discover everything Pets VR can offer and most importantly, have fun!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/0e4a3dc91a042f7cc1fbf00520375b30.poster.avif?t=1646765113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/0e4a3dc91a042f7cc1fbf00520375b30.webm?t=1646765113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399440/extras/0e4a3dc91a042f7cc1fb